====== Nexx WT3020 ======
The [[http://www.nexx.com.cn/index.php/home/detail?pid=199|Nexx WT3020]] is a series of miniature routers based on the [[https://wikidevi.com/wiki/MediaTek_MT7620|MediaTek MT7620n]] with two Ethernet ports and a 802.11n 2T/2R 2.4 GHz 300Mbps wireless interface. There are several models with different hardware and software features.

